/* 
   You need to download the Mozilla CA certificate bundle from:
   https://curl.se/ca/cacert.pem
   
   And save it at this location. This file contains the trusted CA certificates
   that will allow PHP's curl to verify SSL connections.
   
   This file is not created by this script, you need to download it manually.
   The file is updated regularly by Mozilla, so it's good practice to refresh
   it periodically.
   
   After downloading, this comment can be removed.
*/
